+# @beep/editor-app
+
+Local-first desktop editor workspace shell
+
+## Installation
+
+```bash
+bun add @beep/editor-app
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```ts
+import { VERSION } from "@beep/editor-app"
+```
+
+## Development
+
+```bash
+# Build
+bun run build
+
+# Type check
+bun run check
+
+# Test
+bun run test
+
+# Lint
+bun run lint:fix
+```
+
+## License
+
+MIT
